        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://washburnnd.com/about-washburn"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Near Washburn lies Fort Mandan, the winter quarters of the Lewis and Clark Expedition, now a full‑scale replica and museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        5,
        6,
        12,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
