      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washburn%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Washburn sits along the upper Missouri River and became McLean County’s seat in 1883.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washburn%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The North Dakota Lewis and Clark Interpretive Center in Washburn showcases a replica of Fort Mandan and an original expedition canoe.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
